---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ThreeExperience from '../components/three/ThreeExperience.astro';
---

<BaseLayout>
  <main id="main" class="relative">
    <section class="relative isolate min-h-[100svh] overflow-hidden border-b border-bone-50/5" aria-labelledby="hero-headline">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-grid opacity-60" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 -z-10 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-bone-50/20 to-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="container-prose flex min-h-[100svh] flex-col justify-between py-12 sm:py-20">
        <header class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-bone-50">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" class="text-signal-400">
              <path d="M3 11 L11 3 L19 11 L11 19 Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" fill="none" />
              <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="2.2" fill="currentColor" />
            </svg>
            <span>Linkbot</span>
          </a>
          <span class="pill"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-signal-500"></span>Private beta</span>
        </header>

        <div class="max-w-3xl">
          <p class="pill mb-6"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-alarm-500"></span>The current job market rewards visibility</p>
          <h1 id="hero-headline" class="font-display text-[clamp(2.4rem,6vw,4.5rem)] font-light leading-[0.95] tracking-tightest text-balance">
            Your career should not be a <span class="text-bone-200/70">public attack surface.</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-bone-200/80 text-pretty">
            Public profiles turned people into openly readable, permanently indexable targets.
            Recruiters, scrapers, and competitors scan the same surface.
            <span class="text-bone-50">Linkbot</span> is the opposite:
            <span class="text-signal-400">private eligibility</span> instead of public exposure.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
            <a href="#access" class="btn-primary">
              Request private access
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M2 7h10M8 3l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
              </svg>
            </a>
            <a href="#how" class="btn-ghost">How it works</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <footer class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-bone-200/50">
          <span>Identity is verified</span><span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
          <span>Eligibility is private</span><span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
          <span>Matching is permissioned</span>
        </footer>
      </div>
    </section>

    <ThreeExperience />

    <section id="problem" class="relative border-b border-bone-50/5 py-28 sm:py-40" aria-labelledby="problem-headline">
      <div class="container-prose grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-12">
        <div class="md:col-span-4">
          <p class="pill mb-4"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-alarm-500"></span>The problem</p>
          <h2 id="problem-headline" class="font-display text-3xl font-light leading-[1.05] tracking-tightest text-balance sm:text-4xl">
            A profile is no longer a page. It is a continuously mined dataset.
          </h2>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-7 md:col-start-6">
          <dl class="space-y-8 text-bone-200/85">
            <div>
              <dt class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-bone-200/50">01 — Exposure</dt>
              <dd class="mt-2 text-pretty text-lg leading-relaxed">Career history, location, skills, activity, and connections live on the open web. Every field is a coordinate. Together they form a target.</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-bone-200/50">02 — Continuous scanning</dt>
              <dd class="mt-2 text-pretty text-lg leading-relaxed">Recruiters, sales teams, scraping services, and competitors query the same surface. Polling, alerting, and matching engines never sleep.</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-bone-200/50">03 — No consent</dt>
              <dd class="mt-2 text-pretty text-lg leading-relaxed">Visibility became the price of relevance. The user does not approve each viewer, each scan, or each inference drawn from the data.</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="how" class="relative border-b border-bone-50/5 py-28 sm:py-40" aria-labelledby="position-headline">
      <div class="container-prose">
        <p class="pill mb-4"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-signal-500"></span>The position</p>
        <h2 id="position-headline" class="max-w-3xl font-display text-3xl font-light leading-[1.05] tracking-tightest text-balance sm:text-5xl">
          From public exposure to <span class="text-signal-400">private eligibility</span>.
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-bone-200/80 text-pretty">
          Linkbot is a permissioned matching layer. You hold a private, verifiable record of who you are and what you are eligible for.
          Employers request access to specific signals. You decide. Nothing is broadcast, scraped, or quietly indexed.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="container-prose mt-20 grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-bone-50/10 bg-bone-50/5 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <article class="bg-ink-950 p-8">
          <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-bone-200/50">Holder</p>
          <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-light text-balance">You hold the profile.</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-bone-200/75">Identity, credentials, history, and preferences live in your private store. No public URL, no edit page, no API key handed to the open web.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="bg-ink-950 p-8">
          <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-bone-200/50">Channel</p>
          <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-light text-balance">Access is requested, not scraped.</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-bone-200/75">Employers ask for specific signals — "eligible for senior engineering, willing to relocate to Berlin, available in 90 days." You see the request and you respond.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="bg-ink-950 p-8">
          <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-bone-200/50">Result</p>
          <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-light text-balance">Fewer, better matches.</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-bone-200/75">No inbox of unsolicited pings. No scraped leads. Only the conversations that meet your stated criteria, with people who have asked for the privilege.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="claims" class="relative border-b border-bone-50/5 py-28 sm:py-40" aria-labelledby="claims-headline">
      <div class="container-prose">
        <p class="pill mb-4">What we believe</p>
        <h2 id="claims-headline" class="sr-only">Statements of position</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-12">
          <li class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-12">
            <span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-bone-200/50 md:col-span-2">Claim 01</span>
            <p class="font-display text-3xl font-light leading-[1.05] tracking-tightest text-balance md:col-span-10 md:text-4xl">Not every employer should see you. <span class="text-bone-200/60">Only the right ones.</span></p>
          </li>
          <li class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-12">
            <span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-bone-200/50 md:col-span-2">Claim 02</span>
            <p class="font-display text-3xl font-light leading-[1.05] tracking-tightest text-balance md:col-span-10 md:text-4xl">The current job market rewards visibility. <span class="text-bone-200/60">We built for relevance and control.</span></p>
          </li>
          <li class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-12">
            <span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-bone-200/50 md:col-span-2">Claim 03</span>
            <p class="font-display text-3xl font-light leading-[1.05] tracking-tightest text-balance md:col-span-10 md:text-4xl">Your career history is yours. <span class="text-signal-400">Its disclosure is your decision.</span></p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="access" class="relative py-28 sm:py-40" aria-labelledby="access-headline">
      <div class="container-prose max-w-3xl">
        <p class="pill mb-4"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-signal-500"></span>Private beta</p>
        <h2 id="access-headline" class="font-display text-3xl font-light leading-[1.05] tracking-tightest text-balance sm:text-5xl">We open the door in small groups, by invitation.</h2>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-bone-200/80 text-pretty">Tell us who you are and what you are looking for. We reply personally within a few days. No marketing list, no automated drip, no scraped profile.</p>
        <form class="mt-12 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2" action="mailto:hello@linkbot.org" method="post" enctype="text/plain">
          <label class="block">
            <span class="block text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-bone-200/60">Your name</span>
            <input type="text" name="name" required autocomplete="name" class="mt-2 w-full rounded-md border border-bone-50/15 bg-ink-900/60 px-3 py-3 text-bone-50 placeholder:text-bone-200/30 focus:border-signal-500 focus:outline-none" placeholder="Jane Doe" />
          </label>
          <label class="block">
            <span class="block text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-bone-200/60">Email</span>
            <input type="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email" class="mt-2 w-full rounded-md border border-bone-50/15 bg-ink-900/60 px-3 py-3 text-bone-50 placeholder:text-bone-200/30 focus:border-signal-500 focus:outline-none" placeholder="jane@example.com" />
          </label>
          <label class="block sm:col-span-2">
            <span class="block text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-bone-200/60">What you are looking for</span>
            <textarea name="intent" rows="3" required class="mt-2 w-full rounded-md border border-bone-50/15 bg-ink-900/60 px-3 py-3 text-bone-50 placeholder:text-bone-200/30 focus:border-signal-500 focus:outline-none" placeholder="A senior role in climate engineering, remote-first, EU-based."></textarea>
          </label>
          <div class="sm:col-span-2">
            <button type="submit" class="btn-primary">Request private access
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M2 7h10M8 3l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
              </svg>
            </button>
            <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-bone-200/50">We do not share your information. Replies come from a real human at Linkbot OÜ.</p>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="faq" class="relative border-t border-bone-50/5 py-28 sm:py-40" aria-labelledby="faq-headline">
      <div class="container-prose grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-12">
        <div class="md:col-span-4">
          <p class="pill mb-4">FAQ</p>
          <h2 id="faq-headline" class="font-display text-3xl font-light leading-[1.05] tracking-tightest text-balance sm:text-4xl">Direct answers to direct questions.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-7 md:col-start-6">
          <dl class="divide-y divide-bone-50/10">
            <div class="py-6"><dt class="font-display text-xl font-light text-balance">How is this different from a recruiter database?</dt><dd class="mt-3 text-bone-200/80">Recruiter databases index public data and resell access. Linkbot does not aggregate. Nothing is indexed. You decide which signal an employer sees and for how long.</dd></div>
            <div class="py-6"><dt class="font-display text-xl font-light text-balance">What does "private eligibility" mean in practice?</dt><dd class="mt-3 text-bone-200/80">It means an employer can ask, for example, "are you eligible for a senior role, willing to relocate, available in 90 days?" and you answer yes or no — without disclosing your full CV, current employer, or contact details.</dd></div>
            <div class="py-6"><dt class="font-display text-xl font-light text-balance">Do you have an API?</dt><dd class="mt-3 text-bone-200/80">An API is in private testing. We will not expose endpoints that could be used to bypass the consent layer.</dd></div>
            <div class="py-6"><dt class="font-display text-xl font-light text-balance">Who can use Linkbot today?</dt><dd class="mt-3 text-bone-200/80">A small first cohort of senior professionals and a small first cohort of employers with specific roles. We onboard in groups of roughly 20 to keep the matching quality high.</dd></div>
            <div class="py-6"><dt class="font-display text-xl font-light text-balance">Where is the company?</dt><dd class="mt-3 text-bone-200/80">Linkbot OÜ is registered in Estonia and operated by a small team across Europe and Africa.</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="border-t border-bone-50/5 py-12">
      <div class="container-prose flex flex-col items-start justify-between gap-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-bone-200/60">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 22 22" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M3 11 L11 3 L19 11 L11 19 Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" fill="none" />
            <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="2.2" fill="currentColor" />
          </svg>
          <span>© 2026 Linkbot OÜ · Tallinn, Estonia</span>
        </div>
        <nav class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-sm text-bone-200/60">
          <a href="#how" class="hover:text-bone-50">How it works</a>
          <a href="#access" class="hover:text-bone-50">Private access</a>
          <a href="mailto:hello@linkbot.org" class="hover:text-bone-50">hello@linkbot.org</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
